# p-track-drag (plan section 6, M8's judgment): P's track (49, 711.5, 394 x 20 at 1440 x 900; its
# thumb's centre at 49 + 237.17 = 286.17 for P at 2 over the plane's −9.36 .. 9.36) pressed at
# (286, 721) and dragged 50 px left, held. The press jumps P to the pointer (1.99), the drag takes
# it to −9.36 + (236 − 58) / 376 x 18.72 = −0.50 on the 0.01 lattice; mid-drag the thumb (not grown)
# has its 34 px halo in --primary at 26 % and the tip "x = −0.50" above it; P's row is lit, P on
# the plane at (−0.50, 0.25) with its halo and drop lines; Q hidden while the track has the pointer.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 286 721
wait 16
down
move 236 721 over 160
wait 500
shot p-track-drag
up
wait 16
shot released
